# BuilderHQ design direction

Follow `DESIGN.md` for all UI work.

- Feel like a Clash of Clans **community camp**, not generic SaaS
- Use mascots (Barbarian/Archer/Builder/Goblin) via `CampMascot` and `GamePanel`
- Prefer Fan Kit PNGs in `public/characters/`; placeholders are OK until then
- Interactive guides (character asks questions) over cold forms
- Light CSS motion only; Three.js only for a deliberate future hero if mobile-fast
- Keep actions obvious and fast on mobile
- Never present the site as official Supercell
